                                                "example_id": "58b31d13-b5e9-4484-b5b8-f19826357b80",
                                                "sense_id": "b127b26c-8c07-355c-b86b-74dde631a182",
                                                "text": "They formed an oval frame, through which the bluely boundless sea rolled […]"
